      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BEDROCK DINO (3) looks close to another win after finishing second last time (30.72) in a Grade 6 at this track. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Rates highly and will give a great sight. CRYSTAL CROWN (8) is a promising dog in the frame at four of 15 starts including six wins and was in the minors again latest (19.86) over 350m at Murray Bridge Straight. Has a good record here including four wins. Looks well placed here and has the ability. Go well. RIBERY (1) was a winner two back but last start drifted back and wound up strongly to finish a 7 length third at this track (20.18). Solid formlines coming through his last run. Will give a great sight again. WATCH AND SEE (7) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
